{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01726","headline":"杂曲歌辞 侠客行 · 元稹","name":"杂曲歌辞 侠客行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侠客不怕死，怕在事不成。\n事成不肯藏姓名，我非窃贼谁夜行。\n白日堂堂杀袁盎，九衢草草人面青。\n此客此心师海鲸，海鲸露背横沧溟。\n海滨分作两处生，海鲸分海减海力。\n侠客有谋人不测，三尺铁蛇延二国。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}